folder_remove_empty NEWS -- history of user-visible changes.

User-visible highlights per release. The full per-version log is in
`ChangeLog.md`.

* Version 0.5.20260923194832 (2026-09-23)

** The buttons carry a border

   The buttons of the window - [Help] [Light mode/Dark mode] [Exit] [Pause]
   [Start] - are drawn with the clear grey border of the other controls, so the
   row is visible on the light background and not only by its fill.

